# Source masters from the external generation pass (Nano Banana Pro + Google Flow).
#
# Video is excluded: the MP4 masters are large and only the extracted WebP frames in
# public/frames/ are ever served. Keep the MP4s locally — they are the masters you
# would re-extract from if the delivery settings ever change.
*.mp4
*.mov

# Still masters (keyframes, symbol concepts, product shots) ARE committed: they are
# small, they cannot be regenerated identically, and they are the provenance record
# for everything in public/. Nothing on the site references them.
